// ph-033/034: the work order's acceptance sentence asks a PHARMACY "how many
// items am I short of". Verified against the live database, only vendor
// organizations have warehouses (inventory.warehouses joins to org type
// 'vendor' only, 6 rows, no customer rows) -- a pharmacy holds no stock on
// this platform, so low_stock cannot answer it and neither can any variant of
// it. The answerable form of the same question is derived from what the
// pharmacy BUYS: items ordered regularly whose last purchase is older than
// their usual interval. That is reorder_suggestions, and it is a different
// tool from the vendor-side low_stock.
{"id":"ph-033","scope":"pharmacy","q":"ما الأصناف الناقصة عندي؟","tool":"reorder_suggestions"}
